# Project Core

- Frontend: React + JavaScript + Vite.
- Backend: Node.js + Express.js + JavaScript.
- Database: PostgreSQL + Prisma.
- API: REST voi prefix `/api/v1`.
- Kien truc: modular monolith.
- Anh luu trong object storage, khong luu binary trong PostgreSQL.
- Khong sao chep logo, thuong hieu, noi dung, hinh anh hoac giao dien cua Cookpad.

## Rules

- Doc code hien tai truoc khi sua.
- Moi task chi co mot muc tieu ro rang.
- Khong tu y doi framework, database hoac kien truc.
- Khong xoa file chua duoc kiem tra.
- Khong mo rong ngoai pham vi task.
- Route chi khai bao endpoint.
- Controller xu ly request va response.
- Service xu ly business logic.
- Validator xu ly input.
- Middleware xu ly auth, permission va error.
- Moi thay doi database phai co migration.
- Moi API phai co validation va permission phu hop.
- Frontend phai xu ly loading, empty, error va not-found state.
- Sau moi thay doi phai chay lint va test lien quan.

## Completion

Bao cao file da sua, logic da them, lenh da chay, ket qua kiem tra va viec con thieu.
